   "source": [
    "## 5. Model Training and Evaluation functions\n",
    "Because PyTorch does not have a built-in solver, like `.fit()` function from sklearn, we will need to write out the training steps manually. This includes batching data, model definition, loss function, optimization, training loop, stopping, and prediction.  \n",
    "\n",
